	Modding Discord [[Link| "https://discord.gg/mGpRSn9qMF"]]
	<br><br>

	DoLP Discord [[Link| "https://discord.gg/H8PRRw8ZvN"]]
	<br><br>

	DoLP Patreon [[Link| "https://www.patreon.com/DegreesofLewdityPlus"]]
	<br><br>

	Vanilla Blogspot [[Link| "https://vrelnir.blogspot.com/"]]
	<br><br>

	Vanilla Patreon [[Link| "https://subscribestar.adult/vrelnir"]]
	<br><br>
<</widget>>
